      <li>A clear understanding of the requirements of the position</li>
      <li>the deadline for receiving applications</li>
      <li>when the committee will begin reviewing applications and materials received</li>
      <li>when the first screening will be made taking into consideration initial phone and on site interviews</li>
      <li>when interviews will take place</li>
      <li>when the final recommendation(s) will be made</li>
