  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 30px;">
    <li>Describe the requirements of the position at the beginning of the interview</li>
    <li>Make sure you ask “do you understand what the job requires?”</li>
    <li>Ask “are you able to meet the requirements of the position”</li>
    <li>Be very up front with what you have to offer</li>
